   "narration": "ElevenLabs (Alice, British)",
   "updated": "2026-11-14",
   "classroomTitle": "Cavity wall explorer – 3D simulation",
   "instructions": "Open the link and work through the 3D cavity wall simulation (20–30 minutes). Use headphones and press Sound on.\n1. Guided tour: watch all 9 stages.\n2. Build it: assemble the wall in the right order and place the wall ties.\n3. Spot the faults: find all 6 faults. For each one, write down what is wrong and what it causes.\n4. Test yourself: answer the 5 questions. Use \"Show me\" if you get stuck.\nHand in your list of faults and your quiz score.",
   "transcript": "sims/cavity-wall/transcript.html",
   "worksheet": "sims/cavity-wall/worksheet.html",
