   "id": "disc-brakes",
   "title": "Disc brakes & hydraulics",
   "summary": "See inside a car's disc brake in 3D. Press the pedal and watch fluid pressure push the caliper piston and clamp the pads. Inspect each part, add worn pads or air in the fluid, and spot the fault from the pedal feel and stopping distance.",
