   "updated": "2026-11-14",
   "classroomTitle": "Disc brakes & hydraulics – 3D simulation",
   "instructions": "Open the link and work through the 3D disc brake simulation (20–30 minutes). Use headphones and press Sound on.\n1. Guided tour: follow all 9 steps.\n2. Hold to brake: watch the fluid, the piston and the pads. Try slow motion.\n3. Inspect: tap each part and note what it does and what to check.\n4. Spot the fault: add worn pads, then air in the fluid. Describe the pedal feel and stopping distance for each.\n5. Test yourself: answer the 5 questions.\nHand in your fault notes and your quiz score.",
